        "kicker": "This is Wild Sea",
        "heading": "Driven by passion. Drawn to the wild.",
        "text": "<p>Wild Sea Expedition grew from a passion for fishing, travel and unexplored waters. Since 2012, our team has sought out remote saltwater fisheries, from the Red Sea to the Indian Ocean.</p><p>Our journeys bring together fishing, nature and local culture, with experienced guides who share a lasting connection to these places.</p>",
